                     142     ; Timer 0: the next PWM slot begins. Timer 0 runs in mode 2, where it
                     143     ; reloads TL0 from TH0 by itself, so a slot lasts exactly 256 - TH0
                     144     ; cycles however late this interrupt starts. (The code runs on over
                     145     ; 0013H and 001BH: INT1 and Timer 1 are not used.)
