                     241     ;========================= mode 1: Chrono ==============================
                     242     ; A stopwatch. Timer 2 counts the time in packed BCD (the instruction
                     243     ; DA A turns a binary sum back into two decimal digits), so showing it
                     244     ; needs no division. Under a minute the display reads ss.hh, from one
                     245     ; minute m.ss.h, up to 9.59.9.
00D0 9006B3          246     CHRONO: MOV     DPTR,#M_CHRONO
